# Revisions to skip when running `git blame`.
#
# These commits are mechanical, repo-wide reformatting or renaming with no
# behavioral change. Ignoring them keeps `git blame` pointing at the commit
# that actually wrote a line rather than the one that reindented it.
#
# Enable locally with:
#
#     git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
#
# GitHub honors this file automatically in its blame view.

